# Cards: one per slot. Clicking a card sets the view variable cc_pty_sel, and the action
# bar shows that slot's five actions. Each button supplies the situation as `recipient`,
# the one target the cc_pty_<action>_<k> actions declare. The vanilla actions card is
# overridden empty: it would repeat every action under generic names.
